<title>USA: MGM names Corrigan chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>MGM names Corrigan chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Inc Tuesday named Michael Corrigan to the post of senior executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, MGM said Corrigan previously worked as a senior partner at Price Waterhouse in the firm's entertainment division.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>MGM is owned by billionaire investor Kirk Kerkorian.</p>
</text>
